{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"6015004030010","name":"甜花","text":"……ど、どうしよ……","trans":"……怎、怎么办……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-2","name":"プロデューサー","text":"甜花──？","trans":"甜花——？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6015004030020","name":"甜花","text":"た……楽しいのに……\r\n終わっちゃうな……って……","trans":"明……明明很开心……\n却要结束了……我这么想……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-4","name":"プロデューサー","text":"……！\r\nはは、そうか","trans":"……！\n哈哈，这样啊","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-5","name":"プロデューサー","text":"けど、大丈夫だよ","trans":"不过，没关系的","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-6","name":"プロデューサー","text":"ライブが終わっても、\r\nこれで終わりってわけじゃない","trans":"就算演出结束，\n也不代表一切就此结束","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-7","name":"プロデューサー","text":"だから、今はこの時間を\r\n大切に、めいっぱい楽しんできてくれ","trans":"所以，现在要珍惜这段时间\n尽情地去享受吧","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6015004030030","name":"甜花","text":"う……うん……！\r\nそう、だね……！","trans":"嗯……嗯……！\n是、是啊……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}